    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28327" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρᾱπετ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
